        {
          "text": "Wakamusowela mumulindi uutagoli, wakamujalila akusinka kujulu, kuti ateeni limbi masi mane do yamana eyo myaaka iili cuulu, elyo musule lyayaaya uleelede kwaangununwa kaindi kaniini.",
          "type": "text",
