        {
          "text": "Uli acoolwe, alimwi ulasalala, kufumbwa muntu uubuka mububuke obu butaanzi, Kulibaabo bali boobo lufu lwabili talukwe inguzu, pele bayooba bapaizi ba-Leza aba-Kristo, bayooendelezya awe myaaka iili cuulu,",
