        {
          "text": "Lino Saatani sikubeena wakasowegwa muziba lyamulilo uuyaka asulufa, nkukonya nkucibede cinyama, alakwe musinsimi mubeji nkwabede, nkabela bazoopenzegwa isikati amasiku lyoonse lyoonse kukabe kutamani.",
