        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo ndakabona bafu boonse, bapati abaniini, baliimvwi kunembo lya-Leza, elyo mabuku akavununwa, alimwi kwakavununwa ibbuku limwi, ndebbuku lyabuumi. Nkabela bafu bakabetekwa mbuli makani aalembedwe mumabuku, mbuli milimo yabo. ",
